        description="""\"Stage IIB includes: T2b N0, M0.  T2b: Extension and/or implants on other pelvic tissues.  No malignant cells in ascites or peritoneal washings.  N0: No regional lymph node metastasis.  M0: No distant metastasis. (AJCC 6th and 7th eds.)\"""",
