                description="""A human fusion protein composed of the cytokine interleukin (IL)-15 linked with an integrins-targeting moiety, with potential antineoplastic activity. Upon subcutaneous administration, the integrins-targeting moiety of BJ-001 targets tumor cells that overexpress integrins such as alpha v beta 3 (avb3), alpha v beta 5 (avb5) and alpha v beta 6 (avb6) and the IL-15 moiety binds to the IL-2/IL-15 receptor beta-common gamma chain (IL-2Rbetagamma) receptor on natural killer (NK) cells and CD8+ T-l...""",
