                text="Interleukin-2/Interleukin-15 Receptor Agonist NL-201",
                description="""An interleukin-2 (IL-2) and interleukin-15 (IL-15) receptor agonist with high binding affinity for the common heterodimeric receptor IL-2Rbeta-gamma, which is composed of the IL-2 receptor subunit beta (IL-2Rbeta; CD122) and IL-2 receptor subunit gamma (IL-2Rgamma; common gamma; CD132), and no binding affinity for the IL-2 receptor subunit alpha (IL-2Ralpha; CD25), with potential immunoregulatory and antineoplastic activities. Upon administration, IL-2/IL-15 receptor agonist NL-201 targets an...""",
