                text="TLC ELL-12",
                description="""A liposomal formulation of the ether lipid 1-O-octadecyl-2-O-methyl-sn-glycero-3-phosphocholine with potential antineoplastic activity.  TLC ELL-12 induces tumor cell apoptosis via mitochondria- and caspase-mediated mechanisms.  Liposomal encapsulation reduces the free agent's hemolytic toxicity. (NCI04)""",
